- Build/Catalog: compareStop (the common prefix's length), with compareStop_eq,
  compareStop_cons_cons, compareStop_spec, compareStop_unique, compareStop_le; the framed compare
  at its exact time, compareTM_run_stop_ofCfg, of which compareTM_run_ofCfg is now a corollary
  (statement unchanged).
- Build/Contract/Catalog: copyTM_contract (with copyTM_contract_frames) and compareTM_contract
  (exits both verdicts), with their simps field equations.
- Build/Contract/Counter (new, beside CounterLoop): counterRowContract, the one constructor of a
  successful counter row, and its instances incrementTM_contract and decrementTM_contract.
- Build/Contract facade: imports and lists the new module.

New definitions land with their lemmas (policy §1); no @[simp]; no statement changes.

